{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"9qr_mnz_z25","canonical_person_id":"9qr_mnz_z25","id_aliases":[],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["9qr_mnz_z25"],"persons":[{"id":"9qr_mnz_z25","label":"吉挹","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"吉挹","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-074-huan-family:p009:m0253"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-074","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-074-huan-family","source_id":"s-jinshu-074-ws1536331","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-074-huan-family:p009","mention_id":"c-jinshu-074-huan-family:p009:m0253","quote":"吉挹"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"四晉完整選定單元來源內身份暫定；不把近似人名、同姓、遠祖報說變成近親或同人。"}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-jinshu-074-ws1536331","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-074","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-074-huan-family","raw_mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-jinshu-074-huan-family:p009:m0253"],"paragraph_ids":["c-jinshu-074-huan-family:p009"],"table_cell_ids":[],"occurrence_groups":[{"canonical_mention_id":"c-jinshu-074-huan-family:p009:m0253","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-074-huan-family:p009:m0253"],"kind":"paragraph"}],"mention_count":1,"duplicate_mention_count":0,"paragraph_occurrence_count":1,"table_occurrence_count":0,"passage_count":1,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers_not_independent_witness_passages","count_explanation":"1處獨立位置，1個原始錨點；0項為同底本同位置重出。頻次不是來源權威度。"}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-jinshu-074-ws1536331"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-074-huan-family:p009:m0253","start":253,"end":255,"surface":"吉挹","kind":"person","person_id":"9qr_mnz_z25","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依完整單元、引語範圍及平行來源作AI暫定辨識，未圖校。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-074-huan-family:p009","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-074-huan-family"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-074-huan-family:p009","text":"太元初，遷征西大將軍、開府。豁上疏固讓曰：「臣聞三臺麗天，辰極以之增耀；論道作弼，王猷以之時邕。必將仰參神契，對揚成務，弘易簡以翼化，暢玄風于宗極。故宜明揚仄陋，登庸賢俊，使版築有沖天之舉，渭濱無垂竿之逸。用乃功濟蒼生，道光千載。是以德非時望，成典所不虛授；功微賞厚，賢達不以擬心。臣實凡人，量無遠致，階藉門寵，遂叨非據。進不能闡揚皇風，贊明其政道；退不能宣力所蒞，混一華戎。屍素積載，庸績莫紀。是以敢冒成命，歸陳丹款。伏願陛下回神玄覽，追收謬眷，則具瞻革望，臣知所免。」竟不許。及苻堅陷仇池，豁以新野太守吉挹行魏興太守、督護梁州五郡軍事，戍梁州。堅陷涪城，梁州刺史楊亮、益州刺史周仲孫並委戍奔潰。豁以威略不振，所在覆敗，又上疏陳謝，固辭，不拜開府。尋卒，時年五十八。贈司空，本官如故，諡曰敬。贈錢五十萬，布五百匹，使者持節監護喪事。豁時譽雖不及沖，而甚有器度。但遇強寇，故功業不建。","source_position":{"kind":"wikitext_codepoint_positions","raw_path":"sources/jinshu/wikisource-1536331-raw.wikitext","raw_start":2133,"raw_end":2536,"character_positions":[2135,2136,2137,2138,2139,2140,2141,2142,2143,2144,2145,2146,2147,2148,2149,2150,2151,2152,2153,2154,2155,2156,2164,2165,2166,2167,2168,2169,2170,2171,2172,2173,2174,2175,2176,2177,2178,2179,2180,2181,2182,2183,2184,2185,2186,2187,2188,2189,2190,2191,2192,2193,2194,2195,2196,2197,2198,2199,2200,2201,2202,2203,2204,2205,2206,2207,2208,2209,2210,2211,2212,2213,2214,2215,2216,2217,2218,2219,2220,2221,2222,2223,2224,2225,2226,2227,2228,2229,2230,2231,2232,2233,2234,2235,2236,2237,2238,2239,2240,2241,2242,2243,2244,2245,2246,2247,2248,2249,2250,2251,2252,2253,2254,2255,2256,2257,2258,2259,2260,2261,2262,2263,2264,2265,2266,2267,2268,2269,2270,2271,2272,2273,2274,2275,2276,2277,2278,2279,2280,2281,2282,